Third-party components
----------------------
The prebuilt WebAssembly modules and their JavaScript glue
(packages/compute/artifacts/scalar and packages/compute/artifacts/simd, and
the same code embedded in the single-file engine runtime) are generated by
Emscripten 4.0.15 from native/common/preprocess.cpp. Besides code compiled
from that original source, they contain code from the following upstream
projects. That code stays under the upstream licenses; this NOTICE does not
relicense it and does not claim ownership of it.

- Emscripten runtime and library code: available under the MIT license or the
  University of Illinois/NCSA Open Source License, at the choice of the
  recipient. Source: https://github.com/emscripten-core/emscripten
  Toolchain: emsdk 4.0.15, pinned in packages/compute/toolchain-pin.json
  (https://github.com/emscripten-core/emsdk).
  License text, unchanged: packages/compute/EMSCRIPTEN-LICENSE.txt
- musl libc: MIT license. Source: https://git.musl-libc.org/cgit/musl
  (https://musl.libc.org). License text, unchanged:
  packages/compute/MUSL-COPYRIGHT.txt
- LLVM libc++ (C++ standard library headers used by native/common/preprocess.cpp,
  for example <algorithm> and <limits>): Apache License v2.0 with LLVM
  Exceptions, with the legacy University of Illinois/NCSA and MIT licenses
  retained by the project. This is not the plain Apache License 2.0 of LiveMira.
  Source: https://github.com/emscripten-core/emscripten/tree/09f52557f0d48b65b8c724853ed8f4e8bf80e669/system/lib/libcxx
  License text, unchanged: packages/compute/LIBCXX-LICENSE.txt
- dlmalloc (Doug Lea's malloc, version 2.8.6, Emscripten's default malloc/free):
  public domain dedication (CC0 1.0). Source:
  https://github.com/emscripten-core/emscripten/blob/09f52557f0d48b65b8c724853ed8f4e8bf80e669/system/lib/dlmalloc.c
  Notice with the unchanged upstream dedication: packages/compute/DLMALLOC-NOTICE.txt

The compiler toolchain itself (the Emscripten SDK and its container image) is
identified in packages/compute/toolchain-pin.json but is not redistributed.

In built packages and distributions the notice files are in shared/notices/
(EMSCRIPTEN-LICENSE.txt, MUSL-COPYRIGHT.txt, LIBCXX-LICENSE.txt,
DLMALLOC-NOTICE.txt, toolchain-pin.json).

